  "question": {
    "text": "The distance of the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> from the plane <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math> measured parallel to the line <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msqrt><mn>108</mn></msqrt></math> units",
