    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0008_06a1685212eb.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 98px;\" /><br /><br />Equation of the line passing through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and parallel to the given line is&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Any general point on this line is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />This must satisfy the given equation of the plane<br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />The point on the plane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,5</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence, the required distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>54</mn></msqrt></math></p>units"
  }
}